<%# Placement as the hero of „Днес" while it is due — see home/show.

    Offered, not forced: a child can close the placement session, and an
    account made before placement existed never saw one. It retires itself —
    Placement.due? is false once a rating has been settled by real answers, so
    a child who just kept practising is never asked to be placed at a level
    they have already climbed past. The old calibration ladder keeps working
    underneath until then. %>
<div class="hero-band">
  <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
    <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
      <div class="hero-kicker"><%= t("placement.hero_kicker") %></div>
      <div class="hero-title"><%= t("placement.cta_title") %></div>
      <div class="hero-sub"><%= t("placement.cta_sub", count: Placement::QUESTION_COUNT) %></div>
    </div>
    <%# Through the welcome screen rather than straight into question one, so the
        session is explained the same way whichever door a child comes in by. %>
    <%= link_to t("placement.cta"), new_placement_path, class: "button button-white button-large shrink-0 sm:w-auto" %>
  </div>
</div>
